name 'building-data-driven-systems-preassessment-q3_2025'

question 'Which of the following defines a "schema" for a user profile in a web app?'

wrong 'The visual CSS styles used to make the profile page look modern.'
right 'The specific rule that a profile must have a `username` (string) and an `age` (number).'
wrong ' The algorithm that recommends new friends to the user based on their interests.'
wrong 'The `.map()` function used to display the user\'s list of friends.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 2

A schema is a structural blueprint. It defines the required fields (keys) and the types of data (values) that those fields must contain.
MARKDOWN
